### 회원가입
POST http://{{domain}}:{{port}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@test.com",
  "password": "qwer1234",
  "name": "테스트유저",
  "phone": "010-1234-1234",
  "role": "USER"
}

### 로그인
POST http://{{domain}}:{{port}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@test.com",
  "password": "qwer1234"
}

